# Issue #2697 proposal 1 (greenfield flag day): an unpinned principal policy
# read may name the head its client holds (`ifVersion`, `ifStateHash`) and then
# receive that head alone instead of the first page. The 200 response becomes
# the page or that reply. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main
# contains the new contract.
GET /principals/{principalType}/{principalId}/policy added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the response body `anyOf` list for the response status `200`

# Issue #2697 proposal 1: see above.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /principals/{principalType}/{principalId}/policy the response's body `type` changed from `object` to `any` for status `200`

